# Redirects from the old WordPress site's addresses (soupertroopers.org until the October 2026
# launch), so links in Google, press articles and old social posts keep working. Built 2 October
# 2026 from the old site's own sitemaps (sitemap_index.xml).
#
# None of these is forced (no "!"), so a rule only fires when no page exists at that address: a
# new page of the same name - /donate/, /shop/ - always wins, and nothing here can shadow one.
# Netlify ignores the trailing slash when matching, so one rule covers /about-us and /about-us/.
# 301 = moved for good, which tells Google to carry the old page's standing over to the new one.

# Pages
/about-us              /about/                                  301
/humanity-hub          /about/#humanity-hub                     301
/individuals           /get-involved/#individuals               301
/businesses            /get-involved/corporate-partnership/     301
/contact-us            /contact/                                301
/soupermarket          /shop/                                   301
/souper-news           /our-work/#stories                       301
/monthly-debit-order   /donate/                                 301
/donation-confirmation /donate/                                 301
/donation-failed       /donate/                                 301
/donor-dashboard       /donate/                                 301
/elementor-1148        /                                        301

